#
# Default rules for Merge-D365MetadataXml.ps1
#
# One absolute XPath per line, pointing at the *repeated* element whose
# sibling order does not matter (identity is taken from that element's own
# <Name> child). Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored.
#
# Note: order of sibling elements that share the same <Parent> value (e.g.
# AxMenuExtension/Elements/AxMenuExtensionElement) is always treated as
# order-independent automatically and does not need to be listed here.

# AxTable: field order does not matter
/AxTable/Fields/AxTableField

# AxTable: index order does not matter
/AxTable/Indexes/AxTableIndex

# AxSecurityPrivilege: entry point order does not matter
/AxSecurityPrivilege/EntryPoints/AxSecurityEntryPointReference
